==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 15.0 Update|Version 15.0]], Century's End was an Insane stage. This was most likely a translation error.
*Since it contains only [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] enemies, including [[Fallen Bear]], the stage's name being Century's End (世紀末 ''Seikimatsu'' in Japanese) is most likely a reference to the famous heavy metal band [[wikipedia:Seikima-II|Seikima-II]] (聖飢魔II ''Seikimatsu''), whose name means "Holy Devouring Demon II" but also sounds like 世紀末, meaning "End of the Century". The band is led by [[wikipedia:Demon Kakka|Demon Kakka]], a musician also referenced by Fallen Bear's Japanese name and description, and their personas are [[:Category:Aku Enemies|demons]] from a futuristic hyper-evolved dimension known as Makai (魔界, "Demon World"), which is also the Japanese name of [[The Aku Realms]]. The second album they produced was called ''End of the Century'', referring to how they would disband on December 31, 1999 at 23:59:59 JST, in accordance to a fictional prophecy that they would conquer the world for the forces of evil and then disband at the end of the 20th century.
*Prior to [[Version 13.0 Update|Version 13.0]], the enemy base had 800,000 HP instead of 2,500,000.
*This stage shares a theme with [[Moon (Into the Future)|Moon]] from [[Into the Future]], similarly to [[Apocalypse (Merciless)|Apocalypse]].

